  m_text: "Ko\u015Fucun kendili\u011Finden ileri ko\u015Far.\n\nZ\u0131plamay\u0131 \u015Farj etmek i\xE7in ekrana BASILI TUT.\nZ\u0131plamak i\xE7in BIRAK.\n\nK\u0131sa bas\u0131\u015F k\xFC\xE7\xFCk z\u0131plama, uzun bas\u0131\u015F b\xFCy\xFCk z\u0131plamad\u0131r. \xD6ndeki engelleri oku ve b\u0131rakma an\u0131n\u0131 iyi ayarla.\n\nEngele \xE7arparsan ko\u015Fu biter. Hemen tekrar dene ve b\xF6l\xFCm\xFC ge\xE7!"
